  "details": "1. Go to any world in desktop\n\n2. Spam some combination of move/sprint/crouch/jump/mute until the mute action no longer responds.\n\n3. Attempt to (un)mute or open the action menu. Neither works.\n\nThis issue has also manifested on users in VR as well. For desktop at least going into the quick menu and manually (un)muting appears to restore the binding/functionality, but in VR it does not appear to solve it according to some other users who were helping test the repro (imo needs additional testing I can't do at the moment).\n\nI was able to repro the issue (albeit with some difficulty) in multiple unrelated worlds.\n\nHere is a sample video of it happening multiple times in one of the worlds I checked: \n\nhttps://streamable.com/9t5884\n\nNotable timestamps: 0:45 , 1:45 , 2:30 , 4:30",
